  "description": "<p><strong>About puppymelons</strong></p>\r\n<p>puppymelons captured the Instagram world by storm as a female-powered brand. Our posts feature a man&rsquo;s best friend on one slide, and the world&rsquo;s favorite creators on the second slide. We offer trendy, yet simplistic merchandise that consistently sells to fans worldwide. With more than 20 product offerings and new merch lines on the way, puppymelons offers something for everyone. A portion of the proceeds from every purchase will be donated to the Breast Cancer Research Foundation and the American Society for the Prevention of Cruelty to Animals, two causes near and dear to our hearts.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Why Join Us?</strong></p>\r\n<p>The puppymelons affiliate program offers great perks:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Earn 15% commission on every sale generated through your referral code</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Exposure to our 230k+ Instagram followers. We repost to our Instagram story when affiliates tag us. We also feature affiliates in a collab grid post at least once per month. Our grid posts can reach well over 100,000 accounts!</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Opportunities to create exclusive merchandise partnerships, such as our <a href=\"https://puppymelons.com/collections/the-essentials/products/paige-pm-princess-benefiting-the-cybersmile-foundation\">Princess Paige T-Shirt</a> or <a href=\"https://puppymelons.com/collections/the-essentials/products/lucia-love-t-shirt\">Lucia Love T-Shirt</a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Regularly updated product lines with a variety of partnerships</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Consistent communication on new products and exclusive offers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
